cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use this software, please cite it as below."
title: "FQCNN: A Fully Quantum-Native Convolutional Neural Network with Coherent Unitary Pooling"
abstract: >-
  A fully quantum-native convolutional neural network that uses global amplitude
  encoding, shared register-index convolution, coherence-preserving unitary
  pooling, and classification with unitary operations before a terminal
  observable. Implemented in PennyLane.
